WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:05.700
made by ph/ Rayan Mahmoud
faculty of pharmacy , alexandria university

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:19.130
a stroke occurs when the blood flow
in part of your brain is blocked

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:26.340
after just few minutes
the starved brain cells begin to die

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:40.120
normally the brain recieves blood
via two major pairs of arteries

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:44.220
which branch through out brain tissue

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:51.640
and supply your brain cells with
a constant flow of oxygen , glucose and nutrients

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:55.020
necessary for their functions

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:05.480
during a hemorrhagic stroke

00:01:06.921 --> 00:01:09.983
abnormal bleeding disrupts normal blood flow

00:01:11.665 --> 00:01:15.827
for example in an intracerebral hemorrhagic stroke

00:01:17.317 --> 00:01:21.830
a blood vessel bursts spilling blood directly into your brain

00:01:22.231 --> 00:01:25.654
will robbing an intended tissue of nourishement

00:01:26.654 --> 00:01:33.237
both the hemorrhage and lack of blood supply
called ischemia destroy brain tissue

00:01:33.723 --> 00:01:36.250
a subarachnoid hemorrhagic stroke

00:01:38.751 --> 00:01:44.208
occurs when a weak spot in a blood vessel wall
called an aneurysm bursts

00:01:46.994 --> 00:01:51.342
and leaks blood into the tight space between
your brain and your skull

00:01:51.819 --> 00:01:57.105
the high pressure bleeding results in
a serious damage to brain tissue

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:09.596
immediate treatment for your stroke may help
to minimize brain cell injury and death

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.671
in a case of hemorrhagic stroke

00:02:14.127 --> 00:02:16.816
emergency surgery may be necessary

00:02:17.304 --> 00:02:20.471
to repair damaged arteries

00:02:22.154 --> 00:02:25.591
or reduce the pressure of blood on your brain

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:33.470
you may be given medication to help
the brain's blood flow return to normal

00:02:34.238 --> 00:02:39.213
